stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 760 Td
14 TL
(`action_rate`  `-0.005`  Penalize abrupt action changes.) Tj
T*
(`joint_vel`  `-0.0005`  Penalize excessive joint velocity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reward Formulas) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The reaching reward uses a Gaussian distance shaping term:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(reward = exp\(-\(distance / std\)^2\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The lifting reward is clipped between `0` and `1`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(reward = clip\(\(object_z - table_height\) / lift_height, 0, 1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The alignment reward combines horizontal alignment with a lifted gate:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(xy_reward = exp\(-\(xy_distance / xy_std\)^2\)) Tj
T*
(lifted_gate = clip\(\(upper_z - lower_z\) / height_diff, 0, 1\)) Tj
T*
(reward = xy_reward * lifted_gate) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The stack checks use cube-relative geometry instead of Franka finger-joint state. A pair is) Tj
T*
(considered stacked when:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(xy_distance\(upper, lower\) < 0.05 m) Tj
T*
(abs\(\(upper_z - lower_z\) - 0.0468 m\) < 0.01 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The full success check requires both:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(cube_2 stacked on cube_1) Tj
T*
(cube_3 stacked on cube_2) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TERMINATION AND SUCCESS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The task keeps the upstream timeout and cube-dropping terminations. The original stack) Tj
T*
(success condition is replaced with a local success check that does not assume a Franka) Tj
T*
(gripper or finger joints. This is important because the UR3e task uses a surface gripper) Tj
T*
(attached to `tool0`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(An episode is successful when:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  * `cube_2` is geometrically stacked on `cube_1`;) Tj
T*
(  * `cube_3` is geometrically stacked on `cube_2`;) Tj
T*
(  * the pairwise stack checks pass their horizontal and vertical thresholds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TRAINING PATH) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The task supports two learning paths:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Method  Status  Use case) Tj
T*
(`skrl` PPO  Active  Train from scratch without demonstrations.) Tj
T*
(robomimic BC  Registered for future use  Train from demonstrations once an HDF5 dataset) Tj
T*
(exists.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
