() Tj
T*
(Recommended smoke test:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(python scripts/zero_agent.py --task=Isaac-Robots-Stack-Cube-UR3e-Long-Suction-IK-Rel-v0) Tj
T*
(--device cpu --num_envs 1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended first PPO run:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(python scripts/skrl/train.py --task=Isaac-Robots-Stack-Cube-UR3e-Long-Suction-IK-Rel-v0) Tj
T*
(--device cpu --num_envs 16) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The task is expected to be difficult for PPO. If learning is unstable, the recommended) Tj
T*
(progression is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  1. train only the first two-cube stack behavior;) Tj
T*
(  2. tune lift and alignment rewards;) Tj
T*
(  3. re-enable the third cube;) Tj
T*
(  4. increase parallel environments if CPU performance allows;) Tj
T*
(  5. consider scripted or teleoperated demonstrations for robomimic if PPO plateaus.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
