T*
(  __.py`) Tj
T*
(  * `source/isaac_robots/isaac_robots/tasks/manager_based/stack/config/ur3e_gripper/stack_) Tj
T*
(  joint_pos_env_cfg.py`) Tj
T*
(  * `source/isaac_robots/isaac_robots/tasks/manager_based/stack/config/ur3e_gripper/stack_) Tj
T*
(  ik_rel_env_cfg.py`) Tj
T*
